    narr:Narrative_ZypherionAnalyticsAdoption
      narr:theme "Technology adoption reversal: Meridian replaces Zypherion for analytics due to streaming ingestion gap" ;
      skos:note "The organisation has reversed its Zypherion adoption decision. Quinton Fairweather (CTO) announced that critical gaps in Zypherion's streaming ingestion disqualify it; Meridian, which handles both batch and streaming natively, is the new choice. The Q3 2026 migration window is retained." .
  }
}
